settle 8
key escape
assert snap network-offline == true
act Search saved sources
type Linn
settle 2
type et edi
settle 2
type tion A
wait-research-search 240
choose-suggestion Linnet edition A
wait-saved-reader 240
act Reopen kept edition
wait-saved-reader 240
assert snap browser-current-engine == genet.livery
act Open node in Workbench
act Maximize pane
settle 15
assert content-live
capture offline-a
assert snap offline-acquisition-attempts == 0
record-saved-sources offline-a
log Reopened kept A from sealed storage
